# UI Components - Complete Reference

## Component Organization

### App Components (`components/App/`)
Application-specific components used in main views

### Base Components (`components/Base/`)
Reusable base UI components (buttons, inputs, dialogs, etc.)

### ClipDetail Components (`components/ClipDetail/`)
Components specific to clip detail page

### Editor Components (`components/Editor/`)
Advanced editor specific components

### Stats Components (`components/Stats/`)
Statistics page components

### Trim Components (`components/Trim/`)
Trim page specific components

## Base Components

### BaseButton
**Purpose**: Styled button with variants
**Props**:
- `variant`: 'primary' | 'secondary' | 'danger' | 'ghost'
- `size`: 'sm' | 'md' | 'lg'
- `disabled`: boolean
- `loading`: boolean

### BaseInput
**Purpose**: Styled text input
**Props**:
- `modelValue`: string
- `placeholder`: string
- `disabled`: boolean
- `type`: 'text' | 'email' | 'password'
**Events**: `update:modelValue`

### BaseDialog
**Purpose**: Modal dialog wrapper
**Props**:
- `open`: boolean
- `title`: string
- `size`: 'sm' | 'md' | 'lg' | 'xl'
**Events**: `update:open`
**Slots**: `header`, `default`, `footer`

### BaseCard
**Purpose**: Content card container
**Props**:
- `padding`: boolean (default: true)
- `hoverable`: boolean
**Slots**: `default`

### BaseEmptyState
**Purpose**: Empty state with icon and message
**Props**:
- `icon`: string (Iconify icon name)
- `title`: string
- `description`: string

### BasePagination
**Purpose**: Pagination controls
**Props**:
- `currentPage`: number
- `totalPages`: number
- `hasNext`: boolean
- `hasPrevious`: boolean
**Events**: `next`, `previous`, `goto`

### BaseToast
**Purpose**: Toast notification component
**Props**:
- `toast`: Toast object
**Events**: `close`, `action-click`

### BaseBadge
**Purpose**: Small label/badge
**Props**:
- `variant`: 'default' | 'success' | 'warning' | 'danger'
- `size`: 'sm' | 'md'

### BasePill
**Purpose**: Pill-shaped tag
**Props**:
- `removable`: boolean
**Events**: `remove`
**Slots**: `default`

### BasePopover
**Purpose**: Popover container (uses Floating Vue)
**Props**:
- `placement`: 'top' | 'bottom' | 'left' | 'right' | etc.
**Slots**: `trigger`, `content`

### BasePopoverActions
**Purpose**: Action menu in popover
**Props**:
- `actions`: Array of action items
**Events**: Action click events

### MarkdownEditor
**Purpose**: Markdown editor with toolbar
**Props**:
- `modelValue`: string
**Events**: `update:modelValue`
**Features**:
- Toolbar with formatting buttons
- Live preview toggle
- Keyboard shortcuts

### MarkdownPreview
**Purpose**: Render markdown to HTML
**Props**:
- `content`: string
**Features**: Uses `marked` library

### MarkdownTextarea
**Purpose**: Textarea for markdown input
**Props**:
- `modelValue`: string
**Events**: `update:modelValue`

### MarkdownToolbar
**Purpose**: Formatting toolbar for markdown
**Events**: `insert` (text to insert at cursor)

### NotesDisplay
**Purpose**: Display markdown notes with edit button
**Props**:
- `notes`: string | null
**Events**: `edit`

## App Components

### AppClipCard
**Purpose**: Individual clip card in grid/list view
**Props**:
- `clip`: Clip object
- `videoUrl`: string
- `thumbUrl`: string
- `isSelectionMode`: boolean
- `isSelected`: boolean
- `collectionId`: number (optional)
**Events**: 
- `updated`, `deleted`, `toggle-selection`, `shift-click`

**Features**:
- Hover video preview (if autoPlayOnHover enabled)
- Star button
- Published badge
- Context menu with all actions
- Drag to reorder/add to collection
- Selection checkbox (in selection mode)
- Click to view details

### AppHeader
**Purpose**: Main application header
**Slots**: `left`, `center`, `right`
**Features**:
- Logo and branding
- Page title
- Search bar
- User menu

### AppSidebar
**Purpose**: Navigation and filters sidebar
**Features**:
- Navigation links
- Games list with counts
- Collections list
- Create/edit/delete collections
- Collapsible sections

### ClipFilters
**Purpose**: Filter controls for clips page
**Props**:
- `activeFilter`: string
- `viewMode`: 'grid' | 'grouped'
- `totalCount`: number
**Events**: `update:activeFilter`, `update:viewMode`
**Slots**: `actions`

**Filters**:
- All clips
- Published
- Unpublished
- Starred

### ClipsDisplay
**Purpose**: Display clips in grid or grouped mode
**Props**:
- `clips`: Clip[]
- `viewMode`: 'grid' | 'grouped'
- `isEmpty`: boolean
- `isSelectionMode`: boolean
- `collectionId`: number (optional)
- `getVideoUrl`: function
- `getThumbUrl`: function
- `emptyIcon`, `emptyTitle`, `emptyDescription`: string
**Events**: `clip-updated`, `clip-deleted`

### ClipsGrid
**Purpose**: Grid layout for clips
**Props**: Same as ClipsDisplay
**Layout**: Responsive grid (1-5 columns based on screen width)

### ClipsGrouped
**Purpose**: Clips grouped by date
**Props**: Same as ClipsDisplay
**Grouping**: Today, Yesterday, This Week, This Month, Earlier

### ClipMetadata
**Purpose**: Display clip metadata (size, date, resolution)
**Props**:
- `clip`: Clip object
- `format`: 'compact' | 'full'

### ClipTags
**Purpose**: Display and manage clip tags
**Props**:
- `clip`: Clip object
- `editable`: boolean
**Events**: `updated`
**Features**:
- Autocomplete from existing tags
- Smart tag suggestions
- Add/remove tags
- Click tag to filter

### ClipCollections
**Purpose**: Show collections clip belongs to
**Props**:
- `clipId`: number
**Features**:
- List of collections
- Add to collection
- Remove from collection

### ClipActionsMenu
**Purpose**: Context menu with all clip actions
**Props**:
- `clip`: Clip object
- `collectionId`: number (optional)
**Events**: Various action events
**Actions**:
- Rename
- Star/Unstar
- Publish/Unpublish
- Open/Reveal
- Trim
- Advanced Edit
- Export Audio
- Move to Game
- Delete
- Remove from Collection (if in collection)

### ClipNameInput
**Purpose**: Inline editable clip name
**Props**:
- `clip`: Clip object
**Events**: `updated`
**Features**:
- Click to edit
- Save on blur/enter
- Cancel on escape

### ClipPublishedBadge
**Purpose**: Badge showing published status
**Props**:
- `published`: boolean
- `publishedUrl`: string | null
**Features**:
- Click to copy URL
- Visual indicator

### ClipStarButton
**Purpose**: Star/unstar toggle button
**Props**:
- `clip`: Clip object
**Events**: `updated`

### FileDropZone
**Purpose**: Drag and drop file import area
**Events**: `files-dropped`
**Features**:
- Drag over highlight
- Multiple file support
- Shows file count during drag

### ViewModeToggle
**Purpose**: Toggle between grid and grouped view
**Props**:
- `modelValue`: 'grid' | 'grouped'
**Events**: `update:modelValue`

### ClipsPaginationControls
**Purpose**: Load more button and loading state
**Props**:
- `loading`: boolean
- `hasMore`: boolean
- `hasClips`: boolean
**Events**: `load-more`

### SidebarCollectionItem
**Purpose**: Single collection in sidebar
**Props**:
- `collection`: Collection object
**Events**: `edit`, `delete`
**Features**:
- Click to navigate
- Edit button (shows dialog)
- Delete button (confirmation)
- Drag and drop target

### SidebarCollections
**Purpose**: Collections section in sidebar
**Features**:
- List of collections
- Create new collection
- Show more/less toggle

### SidebarCreateInput
**Purpose**: Inline input for creating collections
**Events**: `create`

### SidebarEmptyState
**Purpose**: Empty state for sidebar sections
**Props**:
- `message`: string

### SidebarGames
**Purpose**: Games section in sidebar
**Features**:
- List with clip counts
- Click to filter
- Show more/less toggle

### SidebarSectionHeader
**Purpose**: Section header with show more toggle
**Props**:
- `title`: string
- `count`: number
- `expanded`: boolean
**Events**: `toggle`

### SidebarShowMore
**Purpose**: Show more/less button
**Props**:
- `expanded`: boolean
- `count`: number
**Events**: `toggle`

### BatchOperationsToolbar
**Purpose**: Floating toolbar for batch operations
**Props**:
- `selectedCount`: number
- `selectedClips`: Clip[]
**Events**: All batch operation events
**Actions**:
- Deselect all
- Star/Unstar
- Publish/Unpublish
- Add tags
- Add to collection
- Delete

### BatchTagDialog
**Purpose**: Dialog for adding tags to multiple clips
**Props**:
- `open`: boolean
- `selectedCount`: number
**Events**: `update:open`, `add-tags`

### BatchCollectionDialog
**Purpose**: Dialog for adding clips to collection
**Props**:
- `open`: boolean
- `selectedCount`: number
**Events**: `update:open`, `add-to-collection`

### MoveClipDialog
**Purpose**: Dialog for moving clip to different game
**Props**:
- `open`: boolean
- `clip`: Clip object
**Events**: `update:open`, `move`

### CarouselSlide
**Purpose**: Single slide in carousel (Today's Clips)
**Props**:
- `clip`: Clip object
- `videoUrl`: string
- `posterUrl`: string
- `isActive`: boolean
**Events**: `rename`, `delete`

### CarouselNavigation
**Purpose**: Previous/Next buttons for carousel
**Props**:
- `canPrev`: boolean
- `canNext`: boolean
- `showControls`: boolean
**Events**: `previous`, `next`

### ThumbnailStrip
**Purpose**: Horizontal thumbnail strip for carousel
**Props**:
- `clips`: Clip[]
- `selectedIndex`: number
- `getThumbUrl`: function
**Events**: `select`

