### StatCard
**Purpose**: Single statistic card
**Props**:
- `title`: string
- `value`: string | number
- `subtitle`: string
- `icon`: string
- `iconColor`: string
- `iconBg`: string
- `clickable`: boolean
**Events**: `click`

### GamesList
**Purpose**: List of games with statistics
**Props**:
- `games`: GameStat[]
**Features**:
- Clip count per game
- Storage used
- Published/starred counts
- Click to filter

### TagsList
**Purpose**: List of most used tags
**Props**:
- `tags`: Array<{tag: string, count: number}>

### InfoPanel
**Purpose**: Info items panel
**Props**:
- `items`: Array<{label: string, value: string}>

### ActivityChart
**Purpose**: Last 14 days activity chart
**Props**:
- `days`: Array<{date: string, count: number}>
**Features**:
- Bar chart visualization
- Hover for details
- Date labels

## Trim Components

### TrimHeader
**Purpose**: Header for trim page
**Features**:
- Back button
- Page title

### VideoPreview
**Purpose**: Video player with trim preview
**Props**:
- `videoSource`: string
**Features**:
- Shows selected range
- Loop selected range
- Keyboard controls

### TimelineEditor
**Purpose**: Timeline with trim controls
**Props**:
- `modelValue`: [number, number] (range)
- `maxDuration`: number
- `duration`: string
- `startTime`: string
- `endTime`: string
- `length`: string
- `startPercentage`: number
- `endPercentage`: number
- `frameStripSource`: string
- `isValid`: boolean
- `isSaving`: boolean
**Events**: `update:modelValue`, `save`
**Features**:
- Drag handles for start/end
- Frame strip background
- Time indicators
- Save button

### TimeIndicator
**Purpose**: Time display for timeline
**Props**:
- `time`: string
- `label`: string

### RangeTrimSlider
**Purpose**: Dual-handle slider for trim range
**Props**:
- `modelValue`: [number, number]
- `max`: number
**Events**: `update:modelValue`
**Features**:
- Dual handles
- Visual range highlight
- Percentage-based positioning

## Design System

### Colors
- **Primary**: Orange (#f97316)
- **Success**: Green
- **Danger**: Red
- **Muted**: Gray tones
- **Background**: Light gray (#fafafa)

### Typography
- **Font**: System font stack
- **Sizes**: xs, sm, base, lg, xl, 2xl, etc.
- **Weights**: normal, medium, semibold, bold

### Spacing
- Consistent padding/margin scale: 1-6 (0.25rem increments)
- Larger spacing: 8, 12, 16, 20, 24

### Shadows
- sm: Small shadow for cards
- md: Medium shadow for elevated elements
- lg: Large shadow for modals
- xl: Extra large shadow for popovers

### Borders
- Radius: 0.375rem (rounded), 0.5rem (rounded-lg), 9999px (rounded-full)
- Width: 1px default
- Colors: Gray-200 for dividers, theme colors for emphasis

### Animations
- Transitions: 150ms-300ms for UI changes
- Easing: ease-in-out
- Hover effects: Scale, opacity, background color
- Loading states: Spin animation

### Icons
- **Library**: Iconify
- **Common icons**: material-symbols family
- **Size**: Text-base to text-4xl

### Responsive Breakpoints
- sm: 640px
- md: 768px
- lg: 1024px
- xl: 1280px
- 2xl: 1536px

